f buyers, the Royal Institution of Chartered Surveyors said Tuesday. (published 2301 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =DATA SNAP: UK RETAIL SALES GROWTH SLOWED IN SEPT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K. retail sales growth slowed in September, with higher food prices accounting for most of the increase since the same month last year, according to a monthly survey by the British Retail Consortium. (published 2301 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par MBK PARTNERS IN TALKS WITH LONE STAR FOR PART KEB STAKE - SOURCE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Private equity fund MBK Partners is in discussions with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Lone Star Funds\f28 \uc2 \f2  to buy a part of the stake owned by the U.S.-based company in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Korea Exchange Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a person familiar with the situation said Tuesday. (published 0027 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ASIAN CITRUS TO BUY MAJORITY STAKE IN BEIHAI BPG FOR HK$2.04 BLN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chinese orange grower \f28 \uc2 \f2 Asian Citrus Holdings Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Monday it entered into a formal agreement to buy nearly all of a Guangxi-based maker of tropical fruit juice concentrates for HK$2.04 billion, in its first foray into the juice concentrate business. (published 0003 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS\f28 \uc2 \f2  TV DIVISION 4Q PROFIT LIKELY BETTER VS 3Q - OFFICIAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Samsung Electronics Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 .'s television business will likely have performed "significantly" better in the fourth quarter compared to the third quarter, lifting the division's profit, an executive said Tuesday. (published 0143 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NTT\f28 \uc2 \f2 : TENDER OFFER FOR SOUTH AFRICA'S DIMENSION DATA SUCCESSFUL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 12-10-10 0300GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Nippon Telegraph & Telephone Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday its tender offer for shares of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dimension Data Holdings Plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . has been successful. The Japanese telecommunications giant said it has now acquired 93.42% of the South African technology services provider's outstanding shares. (published 0111 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par TOP HEADLINES - Indian Media \par India's NTPC Among 8 Firms Served Notices For Delays To Develop Coal Blocks - PTI \par India Panel To Recommend \f28 \uc2 \f2 Coal India\f28 \uc2 \f2  IPO Price Band Of INR220-INR240 - Economic Times \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indian Oil Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2  May Take 49% Stake In Nuclear Power Corp. Joint Venture - Economic Times \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Rosatom\f28 \uc2 \f2  Unit Eyeing Nuclear Joint Venture With Indian Company By April - DNA Money \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Vedanta Resources\f28 \uc2 \f2  Chairman: Arbitration On Balco Ends, May Buy Stake By March - PTI \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bridgestone India\f28 \uc2 \f2  To Invest INR26 Bln In New Plant In Pune - PTI \par India's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Tata Motors\f28 \uc2 \f2  Plans Small Car Positioned Between Nano And Indica - Economic Times \par Indian Government Gives Research In Motion To January To Provide Data Access - Livemint.com \par Four Multinationals Put In Bids For India's Paras Pharmaceuticals - Business Standard \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eli Lilly\f28 \uc2 \f2  Files Petition Vs India's Dr Reddy's Over Cancer Drug Patent - DNA Money \par India's Future Group CEO Eyes 40% Stake In \f28 \uc2 \f2 Amar Chitra Katha\f28 \uc2 \f2  - Economic Times \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 12-10-10 0300GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 62500   \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020101012e6ac00002\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
