\par\par \b \uc2 ECB's Draghi:  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Misalignments Must Be Solved Without Manipulation\b0\par\par\uc2 446 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2010\par 17:01\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member Mario Draghi Sunday said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen signals that unilateral action in world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets is not effective.\par \par \uc2 Draghi told a press conference held after the International Monetary Fund and World Bank annual meetings that countries should refrain from manipulating their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to solve the current "misalignments" in world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets last month to tame the yen's continued rise, but the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  still surged Friday to a 15-year high above Y81.7 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 -By Luca Di Leo, Dow Jones Newswires; 202-862-6682; luca.dileo@@dowjones.com [ 10-10-10 1135ET ]\par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governing Council member Ewald Nowotny said Sunday the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy is not targeting a specific exchange rate for the bloc's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that it wants to avoid abrupt changes in the level of the euro.\par \par \uc2 "The ECB does not have an exchange rate goal... We are committed to price stability which means you have to accept exchange rate fluctuations," he said, speaking at a conference in Washington.\par \par \uc2 His remarks come as \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves took the center stage at the annual meetings of the International Monetary Fund, which closed Saturday here. During the meetings, the IMF said it wants to play a larger role to broker international \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  agreements between its members and address \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  misalignments.\par \par \uc2 "That means there is no specific need for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ... What we want is to avoid a situation where we have abrupt (\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) moves," Nowotny added.\par \par \uc2 The ECB's traditional stance is that excessive volatility on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets is not desirable.\par \par \uc2 Nowotny said a more stable international monetary system requires the unwinding of global imbalances, with nations with current account deficits having to boost their exports while surplus countries should bolster their domestic consumption.\par \par \uc2 To achieve this, increased international cooperation is needed, Nowotny said, warning against "bilateralism" in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  talks, saying this could have a negative effect on global growth. "I would warn against bilateralism in specific exchange rate or trade relationships," he said.\par \par \uc2 China and the U.S. are locked in a dispute over the value of the Chinese yuan, with the U.S. complaining the undervaluation of the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is hurting U.S. trade.\par \par \uc2 Nowotny also said there is no risk of deflation in the euro-zone, echoing remarks made by ECB Executive Board member Lorenzo Bini-Smaghi at the same conference earlier.\par \par \uc2 -By Nathalie Boschat, Dow Jones Newswires; nathalie.boschat@dowjones.com [ 10-10-10 1441ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020101010e6aa00009\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
