\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  WEEK AHEAD: Investors Look To Officials For Direction\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrew J. Johnson and Robert Flint   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 793 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2010\par 21:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Investors are squarely focused on statements from top financial officials from around the globe to gauge the near-term direction of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 Every utterance by finance ministers and central bankers gathered in Washington for the weekend meetings of the International Monetary Fund and World Bank will be scrutinized for hints on policy steps that could affect \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels and regimes have become a dominant theme in recent weeks, but investors will also be keenly attuned for any news about asset-purchase programs or other steps to stimulate struggling economies in the U.S. and abroad.\par \par \uc2 No official meetings of financial leaders of the Group of 20 industrial and developing nations or Group of Seven leading economies are scheduled, but the words of some decision makers attending the IMF/World Bank gatherings have the power to shake financial markets.\par \par \uc2 Whatever information filters out from the public speeches and sideline comments will largely determine whether pressure increases on the dollar or whether the beleaguered U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gets some respite when global trading resumes next week, said analysts.\par \par \uc2 On Friday in Washington, Jean-Claude Juncker, Luxembourg's premier and head of the euro group of finance ministers, said the euro's current level was "too strong," and the common \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  immediately fell from an intraday high close to $1.40 to an intraday low at $1.3833. It later regained the $1.39 level, but remained off its recent eight-month peak just above $1.40.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. and European Union have become increasingly frustrated with China's reluctance to allow the yuan to appreciate at a faster pace, which many of its trade partners believe is necessary to rebalance the world payment system and bring exchange rates better in line.\par \par \uc2 There's mounting concern that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  disputes will damage efforts to put the world economy on firmer footing if nations use exchange-rate policies to gain trade advantages against each other. In the best case would be some sort of message than soothes markets.\par \par \uc2 "I think investors are looking to see if there is a consistent view coming out of this weekend, and I'm somewhat doubtful," said Mike Moran, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Standard Chartered Bank in New York.\par \par \uc2 But whether clarity emerges after this weekend is doubtful, said analysts.\par \par \uc2 "There are relatively low expectations of any one narrative," said Nick Bennenbroek, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 But it's not solely this weekend's events that are on the minds of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors. Assumptions remain squared that the Federal Reserve will view it necessary to undertake an additional round of asset purchases to stimulate a lagging U.S. economic recovery. Such a move would provide additional liquidity to world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and have the effect of lowering the value of the dollar, as investors swap cheaper dollars for higher-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis President James Bullard said Friday any decision by Fed policy makers on additional asset purchases will be difficult as the economy has slowed--but not appreciably--and chances of a double-dip recession have receded.\par \par \uc2 Many analysts feel more Japanese government-led \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a distinct possibility if the yen continues to strengthen. The dollar fell to a new 15-year low of Y81.72 Friday.\par \par \uc2 There has been a perceived license by investors to grind the dollar lower against the yen this week, with Japanese authorities unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of the Washington meetings, said Steven Barrow, head of G10 strategy at Standard Bank in London.\par \par \uc2 But caution will return after the weekend, for fear of provoking Japan by pushing the yen lower, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 Before the meetings it would have been difficult for \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the MOF could return if yen appreciation doesn't stop, said Osamu Takashima, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist for \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  in Tokyo.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese government feels compelled to act to lower the value of the yen, largely due to pressure from export industries to keep Japanese-made products competitive in world markets.\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew J. Johnson and Robert Flint; Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2216; andrewj.johnson@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 TALK BACK: We invite readers to send us comments on this or other financial news topics. Please email us at TalkbackAmericas@dowjones.com. Readers should include their full names, work or home addresses and telephone numbers for verification purposes. We reserve the right to edit and publish your comments along with your name; we reserve the right not to publish reader comments [ 10-08-10 1558ET ]\par \par \uc2 1141   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020101008e6a8000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
